{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y把很多随音乐推进的细微质感压成了短词，尤其长段里少了X那种“这一刻怎么变成下一刻”的层次。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"Y在实际停留时间里更容易一眼先抓住左边的人物变化，再用右边几组感觉补上气氛，所以“发生了什么—为什么会这样—下一步怎么变”能连续跟住，十四段也更像同一个人的一条心理线。X的感受描写更细、更有身体感，而且到时出现能贴住音乐变化，但多数屏幕同时存在太多完整句和意象，普通观众边听边扫时常会只捞到几片，反而削弱了主线和因果的即时获取。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7a762718-8dd2-44ef-984c-5aff252fb5fa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T064554190935Z", "elapsed_seconds": 11.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T06:46:05.453369+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6f26db7876a02b16583d32d716dd045a4d9a925482ee6b3f12a5a79b0bef6f2f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screen